s is shown in the Risk calendar and drought view.", "Roof wetting: the one-storm sizing (net zero plan, one storm, season of storms) applies the roof coefficient to all the rain, with no wetting loss - the safe side for sizing the reservoir. The day-by-day views (risk calendar and drought, closed loop) take the first 1 mm of each rain day off the roof and the road before the coefficient - the safe side for supply. Over the 125-year record this gives about 13 % less roof water a year than no wetting loss.", "Open-ground curve number and road length are placeholders until measured."], "gumbel": {"mu": 46.7, "beta": 17.02, "years": 125, "record_mm": 148.6, "note": "comparison only (rejected for this record): 10/25/50/100-yr = 85/101/113/125 mm"}, "gev": {"k": -0.13448, "u": 45.839, "a": 14.0159, "xi": 0.13448, "years": 125, "first_year": 1901, "last_year": 2025, "record_mm": 148.6, "record_year": 1981, "method": "GEV, L-moments (Hosking 1990)", "note": "IMD 0.25 deg grid, 1901-2025, annual maximum 1-day rain; 10/25/50/100/200-yr = 83/102/118/135/154 mm"}, "extremes": [{"T_yr": 2, "gev_mm": 51.104712403384745, "gumbel_mm": 52.93804990829993}, {"T_yr": 5, "gev_mm": 69.13235691884103, "gumbel_mm": 72.22897857464696}, {"T_yr": 10, "gev_mm": 82.67271789691947, "gumbel_mm": 85.00125191085783}, {"T_yr": 25, "gev_mm": 101.85580850961735, "gumbel_mm": 101.13905312980046}, {"T_yr": 50, "gev_mm": 117.75356018434478, "gumbel_mm": 113.11099595806789}, {"T_yr": 100, "gev_mm": 135.09337968906806, "gumbel_mm": 124.99453983973737}, {"T_yr": 200, "gev_mm": 154.06741409849678, "gumbel_mm": 136.83472266594612}, {"T_yr": 500, "gev_mm": 181.97613806943474, "gumbel_mm": 152.4555956347686}], "design_T": 100.0, "wells": [{"id": "S1", "tier": "shallow", "cb": "CB1", "K": 0.1, "intake_m3d": 14.372786390173303, "rule": "Darcy (K x area x gradient)", "structure": "shaft", "d_m": 1.0, "open_m": 15.0, "open_from_m": 0.0, "open_to_m": 15.0, "area_m2": 47.90928796724434}, {"id": "S2", "tier": "shallow